{"articleNo":"107676","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=107676&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"제14기 WEST 프로그램 참가자 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.06.11","hit":"2752","attachments":[{"name":"제14기 WEST 프로그램참가자모집공고.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=107676&attachNo=72878"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2008</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">년 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">8</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">월 한</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">미정상회담에서 합의되고 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">년 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">5</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">월 양국정상 회담에서 운영기간이 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">5</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">년 연장 합의된 한</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">미 취업연수</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(WEST: Work, English Study, Travel) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">프로그램 추진과 관련하여 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">『</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">년도 제</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">14</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">기 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">WEST </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">프로그램</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">』</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">참가자를 붙임과 같이 모집하오니</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 관심있는 학생들의 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">※ </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">『</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">년도 제</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">14</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">기 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">WEST </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">프로그램</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">』</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">에 대한 자세한 모집 안내는 정부해외인턴 통합 홈페이지 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(http://www.ggi.go.kr)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">에서도 확인가능 함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">참여하고자 하는 학생은, 해당 웹페이지에서 온라인 신청을 개별적으로 한 후, 그 외 추가 서류들을 모두 구비하여 <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ff0000\" color=\"#ffffff\">국제교류교육원(테크노관 4층 T458)으로 2014. 7. 2.(수) 오후 5시까지 제출</font>해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">붙임</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">제</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">14</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">기 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">WEST </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">프로그램 참가자 모집 공고문 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">부</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
